  "description": "By day, Yoon Haeseul is a kindergarten teacher. By night, she is Lee Saerim, an explicit adult audio content writer for the company 'Vox.' For the past two years, she thought she was hiding her double life successfully. \n\n\"So, I'm asking... are you, Teacher Haeseul, the writer 'Lee Saerim' from 'Vox'?\" \n\nAt least, until she gets caught by Kwon Chanyool—her kindergarten student's proxy guardian and her long-time unrequited crush. \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70655847), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%9F%AC%EB%B8%8C-%EC%BB%A4%EB%AF%B8%EC%85%98.txt-19%EC%84%B8-%EC%99%84%EC%A0%84%ED%8C%90/4993)   \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70655436)",
